# structure.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Registration only, no explanation
- Directory tree + registration table
- Updated in real time on document changes
- Clean and concise

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Global directory

### H2 (required)
- Directory tree: full project structure (tree)
- Document registration table: document / path / update trigger

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Folder registration table: folder / purpose / scenario
- [optional] Changelog: date / change
